ft ucode

1 11 ucodeNumber   # 42
2 16 ucodeNumber   # 0xdeadbeef
3 16 ucodeNumber   # 0XFF
4 11 ucodeNumber   # 0b1010
5 11 ucodeNumber   # 0o17
6 14 ucodeNumber   # 017, legacy octal
7 12 ucodeFloat    # 1.5
8 11 ucodeFloat    # 1.5e3
9 14 ucodeFloat    # 2E-4
10 12 ucodeNumber  # the sign of -1 is an operator, the digit a number
